{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through cardboard tracks, master your momentum and shave off milliseconds to earn medals and challenge friends on a fingerboard with no speed limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/862a3ae678f837a7b4af61a627b1939a.webp?t=1772963032\" width=1 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/a86dcf0aa800558780c73e7e04854062.poster.avif?t=1772963032\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/a86dcf0aa800558780c73e7e04854062.webm?t=1772963032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race through skate-infused parcours as fast as possible!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay and perfect your runs to earn medals, unlocking more rooms in your home featuring new levels and abilities.</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/53ff724b6f727a1189edf96f3bc1f9fe.webp?t=1772963032\" width=1 height=32 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/035cdf42b61313b5a71d885282686139.poster.avif?t=1772963032\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/035cdf42b61313b5a71d885282686139.webm?t=1772963032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><